      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯鲁得：普隆德拉的卫星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 12,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Izlude, the satellite of Prontera. Izlude was built to support Prontera's defense and to accommodate its burgeoning population.",
      "translation" : "欢迎来到依斯鲁得，这座普隆德拉的卫星城。依斯鲁得是为支援普隆德拉的防务、容纳不断增加的人口而建成的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 14,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯鲁得：普隆德拉的卫星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 15,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Points of interest include the Swordsman Association building which allows adventurers to change their job to Swordsman, and the Battle Area that is North of Izlude.",
      "translation" : "这里有剑士公会大楼，冒险者可以在那里转职为剑士；依斯鲁得北边还有战斗区域。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 17,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯鲁得：普隆德拉的卫星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "At the docks, you may take a ship and travel to ^123972Alberta^000000 or ^2F0400Byalan Island^000000.",
      "translation" : "你可以在码头搭船前往^123972艾尔贝塔^000000或^2F0400海底洞窟^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯鲁得：普隆德拉的卫星城]"
    },
    {
