      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From Izlude, ^6D6FE0Prontera^000000 is located to the Northwest, and ^1F3A11Payon^000000 is located to the South.",
      "translation" : "从依斯鲁得向西北可到达^6D6FE0普隆德拉^000000，向南可到达^1F3A11斐扬^000000。"
    },
    {
