      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Enjoy your travels in the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom.",
      "translation" : "祝你在卢恩-米德加尔特王国旅途愉快。"
